# TASK-27 9d: NetSurf in a window (exploratory).
serial init: gui: gpu on its own page
screen Type help to begin, or help tour.
screen ~> _
pause 3000
type netsurf -v 2> nslog\r
pause 20000
click 122 119
pause 3000
click 300 87
pause 500
type search llcache nslog\r
pause 2500
shot netsurf-log1
type search schedule nslog\r
pause 2500
shot netsurf-log2
type search conver nslog\r
pause 2500
shot netsurf-log3
type poweroff\r
exit
